| actual offset | window hash | candidate | exact match | compared bytes |
| ---: | ---: | --- | --- | ---: |
| 0 | 1 | true | false | 1 |
| 1 | 1 | true | true | 1 |
\image(figures/rabin_karp_tiny.svg)
// result_end
